# Attention — Layout A: band-grouped list

Rows grouped under band headers, worst first. Scannable triage list:
"what do I rescue first".

```
+----------------------------------+
| Needs attention                  |
+----------------------------------+
| COLD (2)                         |
|  * Initech         34d quiet     |
|  * Umbrella        29d quiet     |
| COOLING (3)                      |
|  * Acme Corp       12d quiet     |
|  * Stark Ind       10d quiet     |
|  * Wayne Ent        9d quiet     |
| HEATING (1)                      |
|  * Globex          5 events/24h  |
+----------------------------------+
| bands: cold, cooling, heating    |
+----------------------------------+
```

Config: bands[] picks which bands show, limit per band,
computedField = which attention signal drives it.
